Package: tunnel-keeper
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Arvind <arvindkumarsjpr@gmail.com>
Section: net
Priority: optional
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), openssh-client, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, gir1.2-ayatanaappindicator3-0.1, python3-pymysql
Recommends: sshpass, gnome-shell-extension-appindicator
Description: keep SSH tunnels alive, with a top-bar status indicator
 A systemd user service checks each configured SSH port-forward every few
 minutes (MySQL tunnels with a real SELECT 1) and reopens any that are down
 or half-dead. A top-bar indicator shows their status and lets you create,
 kill, restart and refresh tunnels. Control from scripts with tunnelctl.
